{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "c64cbfe4-ea59-8993-8df0-572aafcb3d50",
  "created_at": "2026-01-08T11:55:20-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Gina DeLuca",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T11:51:33-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T11:51:36-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good morning, Kevin. Good morning, and how are you today? I hope I am not disturbing you before your lunch."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T11:51:45-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, no, you're fine. It's quiet right now. What can I do for you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T11:51:52-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, you are very kind. My name is Gina DeLuca. I am a homeowner here in the Historic Hill, and I am calling about something small, maybe, but it is making me a little worried."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T11:52:07-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, go ahead, tell me what's going on."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T11:52:11-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "There is a catch basin, the drain on the street, at the corner near my house. It is full of leaves. Completely covered. For three days now it is like this, and the puddle there, it never goes down."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T11:52:27-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Three days, okay. And it hasn't rained, right? This is just sitting there?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T11:52:33-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, exactly, no rain, no snow, nothing. The weather is dry. So the water does not come from a storm. It just stays, and now it is starting to move down the side of the road toward my neighbor's garage. I am afraid it will go inside."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T11:52:53-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Gotcha. So it's creeping toward the neighbor's garage. Let me write that down. What's the address, or the closest one to that corner?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T11:53:03-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I am at 354 Rhode Island Avenue. The drain is on the corner just next to my house, so you can use this address."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T11:53:14-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Three fifty-four Rhode Island Avenue, Historic Hill. Catch basin on the corner, blocked with leaves, standing water, running toward a garage next door. Did I get that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T11:53:26-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, yes, perfect. Thank you. Please, may I ask, will you open a work order for this? And is it possible to know for what date?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T11:53:37-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yep, I'll put in a work order right now. As for the date, I'd say the crew will get to it in the next few days, probably, but I can't promise a specific day. They've got a list."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T11:53:53-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I understand, of course. A few days is okay, I only worry about the garage. If the water goes inside, it is a big problem for the neighbor."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T11:54:05-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right. I'll mark it as water moving toward a building so it gets looked at sooner. Can I get a number in case they need to reach you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T11:54:17-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Of course. It is 401-555-0169. This is my landline, so please call in the day. Or, if I do not answer, you can leave a message, I will hear it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T11:54:30-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, zero-one-six-nine. Got it. Okay, you're all set, the work order's in."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T11:54:36-05:00",
      "duration": 21,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you so much. Oh, one more thing, if you allow me. I wanted to send you a picture of the drain, but my phone, it had a software update last week, and it ate half of my storage. Now it says it is full. So I cannot take the picture."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T11:54:57-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ah, that's annoying. Don't worry about the picture, the description is plenty. They'll see the leaves as soon as they pull up."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T11:55:07-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good, good. Then I will not trouble you more. You have been very helpful, Kevin. God bless you, and have a lovely afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T11:55:17-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too, Ms. DeLuca. Take care."
    }
  ],
